Current motivic bottleneck.

Construct an explicit characteristic-zero algebraic correspondence realizing the missing unsquared quadratic sign associated with 3(7-zeta_3), rather than only its tensor square.

Current concrete target from the preserved lineage:
produce a projected dimension-eight cycle Gamma on the stated finite/exceptional carrier × Fermat support, prove its target projection is nonzero, compute a nonzero pairing c, and normalize the inverse including the finite-carrier factor.

Acceptance:

* explicit cycle/correspondence;
* source and target motives typed;
* projector orientation checked;
* Galois covariance/descent checked;
* nonzero pairing proved;
* inverse normalization proved;
* no software-only promotion.
